[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817282746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105544#issuecomment-2817282746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544","id":2817282746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7FK6","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T18:20:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T18:20:20Z","body":"`JSONRPC` which we use as base for the language server, isn't really equipped for bidirectional communication. I guess we need to add support for handling response objects. Or at least we need to discard them without errors, but I'm not sure whether there is something in LSP where we would care about the response.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817282746/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817283817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105544#issuecomment-2817283817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544","id":2817283817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7Fbp","user":{"login":"Cretezy","id":2672503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzI1MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2672503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy","html_url":"https://github.com/Cretezy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T18:23:50Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T18:23:50Z","body":"@HolonProduction I agree, seems like removing this line would fix this issue:\n\nhttps://github.com/Cretezy/godot/blob/72c99906f3888dac6aec93c983d312eecd617897/modules/jsonrpc/jsonrpc.cpp#L131","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817283817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817290694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105544#issuecomment-2817290694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544","id":2817290694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7HHG","user":{"login":"Cretezy","id":2672503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzI1MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2672503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy","html_url":"https://github.com/Cretezy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T18:45:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T18:45:19Z","body":"Looking at the spec, these are the responses that have replies from the client:\n\n- [workspace/configuration](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_configuration)\n- [workspace/workspaceFolders](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_workspaceFolders)\n- [workspace/applyEdit](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_applyEdit)\n\nAnd currently only `workspace/applyEdit` is sent from the Godot LSP","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817290694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817290963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105544#issuecomment-2817290963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544","id":2817290963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7HLT","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T18:46:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T18:46:09Z","body":"More like we should not default to an empty method [here](https://github.com/Cretezy/godot/blob/72c99906f3888dac6aec93c983d312eecd617897/modules/jsonrpc/jsonrpc.cpp#L102) if the dictionary does not contain one. But this requires a bit of additional care because `process_action` calls itself for [batched requests](https://www.jsonrpc.org/specification#batch). And a batch that contains response and request objects is most certainly invalid per json rpc and should report an error.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817290963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825110471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105544#issuecomment-2825110471","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544","id":2825110471,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oY8PH","user":{"login":"Cretezy","id":2672503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzI1MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2672503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy","html_url":"https://github.com/Cretezy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T18:05:30Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T18:05:30Z","body":"@HolonProduction Correct. In the case of batched request, I think we can either:\n\n- Always drop silently requests without method (replies), even recursively (the simple approach, but slightly incorrect), or\n- When receiving a batch request, check that either all sub-requests have or don't have a method","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825110471/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3042294828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105544#issuecomment-3042294828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544","id":3042294828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61Vbws","user":{"login":"eduardomosko","id":62731713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzMxNzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62731713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko","html_url":"https://github.com/eduardomosko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-06T17:49:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-06T17:49:32Z","body":"Hello, just sharing my ugly workaround for neovim:\n\n```lua\n---@diagnostic disable\n\nlocal Client = require('vim.lsp.client')\nlocal original_write_error = Client.write_error\nClient.write_error = function(self, code, err)\n\tif self.name == 'gdscript' and code == vim.lsp.client_errors.NO_RESULT_CALLBACK_FOUND then\n\t\t-- ignore this kind of error\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\toriginal_write_error(self, code, err)\nend\n\n---@diagnostic enable\n```\n\nPutting this anywhere in your config should ignore this specific error. The diagnostic comments are just so lua_ls won't yell at you for monkey patching the internals of a class, not needed if you don't use it","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3042294828/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]